                <note rend="inline" type="source">833.51/902: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Uruguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Wilson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-06-03T19:00:00-04:00">June 3, 1940—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>53. Your 93, June 3, 11 a.m. Suggested statement contained in your telegram under
                    acknowledgment is approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
